### 8. Database & Data Layer

| Aspect | Technology | Purpose |
|--------|-----------|---------|
| **Primary Database** | PostgreSQL (Supabase managed) | User accounts, board metadata, access control, persistent storage |
| **Caching Layer** | Redis (Upstash) | User presence, cursor positions, AI response caching, WebSocket sessions |
