#### PostgreSQL Schema Design

```sql
-- Users (managed by Supabase Auth)
users (
  id uuid PRIMARY KEY,
  email text UNIQUE,
  name text,
  avatar_url text,
  created_at timestamptz
)

-- Boards
boards (
  id uuid PRIMARY KEY,
  title text NOT NULL,
  owner_id uuid REFERENCES users(id),
  created_at timestamptz,
  updated_at timestamptz,
  is_public boolean DEFAULT true,
  thumbnail_url text
)

-- Board snapshots (for persistence)
board_snapshots (
  id uuid PRIMARY KEY,
  board_id uuid REFERENCES boards(id),
  yjs_state bytea,  -- Yjs document state
  object_count int,
  created_at timestamptz
)

-- Board access (future: permissions)
board_access (
  board_id uuid REFERENCES boards(id),
  user_id uuid REFERENCES users(id),
  role text DEFAULT 'editor',  -- owner/editor/viewer
  PRIMARY KEY (board_id, user_id)
)
```

#### Redis Cache Schema

```
Keys:
  presence:{board_id}           → Set of active user_ids (TTL: 30s)
  cursor:{board_id}:{user_id}   → JSON {x, y, timestamp} (TTL: 5s)
  ai_cache:{command_hash}       → Cached AI response (TTL: 24h)
  ws_session:{session_id}       → User session metadata (TTL: 1h)
```

