#### API Endpoints

**REST API:**
```
GET    /api/boards           # List user's boards
POST   /api/boards           # Create new board
GET    /api/boards/:id       # Get board metadata
PATCH  /api/boards/:id       # Update title/settings
DELETE /api/boards/:id       # Delete board
POST   /api/ai/command       # Execute AI command
GET    /api/ai/capabilities  # List available commands
```

**WebSocket Events:**
```
Client → Server:
  cursor:move     → {x, y}
  cursor:leave    → {}
  presence:join   → {user}
  presence:leave  → {}

Server → Client:
  cursor:update   → {userId, x, y, name}
  presence:update → {users: User[]}
  yjs:sync        → (handled by y-websocket)
```

